<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμῡθ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>encouragement, exhortation</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				450d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.65
			</span></i> W.(pl.) ; <i>reassurance, gentle persuasion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				70b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				720a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>consolation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				365a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.1.18
			</span></i> ; <i>diversion, distraction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				224a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>relief from, abatement of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Them.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πόνων καὶ τῶν κινδύνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dio</u>
					52
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταλαιπωρούντων</span>, of
			sleep, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>explanation, solution</i> of a difficulty, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πρὸς τὴν ἀπορίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.395f
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				929f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				361.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>excuse</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν τινὰ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				4.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>, al.</div>
